0,			$ reserved
6,			$ Link Path Size
"20 03 24 01 30 64",	$ Link Path to disable autobaud attribute.
0x0002,			$ No support for settable path, scaling, scaling links, or
			$ real time update of value.  Value is gettable and 
			$ Settable.  Enumerated strings are supported.
4,			$ Data Type - boolean
1,			$ Data Size
"Autobaud",		$ Parameter Name
"",			$ Units String
			$$$$$$$$$$ Help string $$$$$$$$$$$
"If Enabled, the module adjusts to the current network baud rate. If Disabled,\nthe baud rate can be set to a fixed value. When Disabling, no power cycle is\nrequired. When Enabling, change takes effect after the next power up.",
0,1,0,			$ Min, Max, and Default values
1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0;	$ Not Used

